[7.519699, "o", "\u001b[1;33m$ cargo run --release -- --help\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[8.528621, "o", "RoCo AI — Collaborative Writing Assistant\r\n\r\nUsage:\r\n  roco                                 Start interactive chat (natural language)\r\n  roco <prompt>                        Chat with a starting prompt\r\n  roco <subcommand> [args]             Run a specific command\r\n  roco <subcommand> --help             Show help for a specific command\r\n\r\nCommands:\r\n  session      Persistent multi-turn chat sessions\r\n  interact     Interactive CLI with pacing (default mode)\r\n  story        Structured short story from premise\r\n  story-mode   Interactive story writing assistant\r\n  sm           Alias for story-mode\r\n  session      Session management (new, list, show, delete)\r\n  workspace    Workspace management (new, list, show, delete)\r\n  vector-search Local offline vector embedding search\r\n  game         Adventure game mode (interactive fiction)\r\n  ttrpg        TTRPG campaign and world building system\r\n  html         Live HTML canvas\r\n  code         AI coding assistant\r\n  eval         Run evaluations\r\n  bless        Bless snapshot as new oracle\r\n  export       Export a finished story\r\n  inferd       Inference daemon control (start/stop/restart/status)\r\n  gateway      API gateway control (start/stop/restart/status)\r\n  stop         Stop background daemons\r\n  jobs         Show daemon status and active jobs\r\n  gui          Desktop GUI (--features desktop)\r\n  pet          Desktop pet (--features desktop)\r\n  rwkv         Smoke-test the RWKV backend\r\n  grammar      Grammar-constrained decode test\r\n  gpu-check    Show Vulkan device + model info\r\n  stats        Story/workspace statistics and review\r\n  inspect      Model & system inspection (caches, sessions, config)\r\n"]
[8.52891, "o", "  eval-suite   Deterministic evaluation suite\r\n\r\nIdentity:\r\n  whoami       Show what RoCo is and what it knows about you\r\n  version      Show version\r\n\r\nConfig: RWKV_MODEL / .roco/config.toml / $ROCO_DIR/config.toml\r\n"]
