[33.176564, "o", "---\r\ntitle: \"The Time Freeze\"\r\ngenre: \"Sci-Fi\"\r\ntone: \"Suspenseful\"\r\nword_count: 79\r\ncreated_at: \"2026-08-01 10:31:25\"\r\n---\r\n\r\n# World Bible\r\n\r\n## Characters\r\n\r\n### Alistair\r\n\r\nThe clockmaker\r\n\r\n## Setting\r\n\r\nA dusty Victorian workshop\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# The Time Freeze\r\n\r\nAlistair adjusted the gears. The ticking stopped. The world froze.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# The Time Freeze\r\n\r\nAlistair adjusted the gears. The ticking stopped. The world froze.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# The Time Freeze\r\n\r\nAlistair adjusted the gears. The ticking stopped. The world froze.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# Synopsis\r\n\r\nA clockmaker builds a device that freezes time, only to discover it has a terrible cost.\r\n"]
